# .gitignore
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Git tracks every file in this folder EXCEPT the ones listed here.
# These are files that are either generated (so they can always be
# rebuilt) or specific to your computer. Keeping them out of Git keeps
# the repo small and keeps other people's machines from fighting yours.
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# The finished site that `npm run build` produces. Cloudflare rebuilds
# this itself from the source, so there's no reason to store it.
dist/

# Downloaded code libraries (Astro itself and everything it depends on).
# `npm install` recreates this folder from package.json in a minute.
node_modules/

# Astro's own cache / generated TypeScript helpers.
.astro/

# macOS Finder clutter.
.DS_Store

# Log files npm sometimes leaves behind.
npm-debug.log*

# Obsidian's per-vault settings and workspace state, if you open
# src/content/pages/ as a vault. Editor preferences, not site content.
.obsidian/
